<option value="$10,000 - $25,000 (Multi-System Architecture)">$10,000 - $25,000 (Multi-System Architecture)</option><option value="$25,000+ (Custom Enterprise / Full Scale)">$25,000+ (Custom Enterprise / Full Scale)</option><option value="Monthly Retainer / Ongoing Optimization">Monthly Retainer / Ongoing Optimization</option></select></div><div id="w-node-_91e15c8c-7993-6ef9-90a6-07c5cf20dc65-de3b2131" class="contact-form-div"><label for="Project-details" class="contact-label">Project details*</label><textarea required="" placeholder="Tell us more about your idea" maxlength="5000" id="Project-details" name="Project-details" data-name="Project details" class="contact-input text-area w-input"></textarea></div><div id="w-node-_5ebe538b-19be-86b5-7a55-dcb035d617b4-de3b2131" class="contact-form-div"><label class="w-checkbox checkbox-button-block"><div class="w-checkbox-input w-checkbox-input--inputType-custom checkbox-button"></div><input type="checkbox" id="checkbox" name="checkbox" data-name="Checkbox" required="" style="opacity:0;position:absolute;z-index:-1"><label class="checkbox-button-text w-form-label" for="checkbox">Subscribe to our newsletter for all the latest Shape goss!</label></label></div></div><input type="submit" data-wait="Please wait..." class="common-button contact-button w-button" value="Send inquiry"></form><div class="success-message w-form-done"><div>Thank you! Your submission has been received!</div></div><div class="w-form-fail"><div>Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid faq-grid"><div class="faq-div"><div class="common-heading-div"><h2 data-w-id="1d2aabcf-baec-ed5c-090e-1c581a1932b0" class="h2-heading faq-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p data-w-id="1d2aabcf-baec-ed5c-090e-1c581a1932b2" class="large-paragraph faq-paragraph">We’ve heard it all. Here’s everything you need to know before working with us.</p></div></div><div class="faq-div"><div class="accordion-div"><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="1d2aabcf-baec-ed5c-090e-1c581a1932b6" class="accordion w-dropdown"><div class="accordion-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-icon-div"><img src="/images/faq-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="FAQ arrow icon" class="faq-icon"></div><div class="large-paragraph faq-heading">What types of clients do you work with?</div></div><nav class="accordion-list w-dropdown-list"><p class="large-paragraph faq-ans">We partner with early-stage startups, scaling SaaS teams, and enterprise AI companies.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="1d2aabcf-baec-ed5c-090e-1c581a1932bf" class="accordion w-dropdown"><div class="accordion-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-icon-div"><img src="/images/faq-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="FAQ arrow icon" class="faq-icon"></div><div class="large-paragraph faq-heading">Can we start with a single page or smaller scope?</div></div><nav class="accordion-list w-dropdown-list"><p class="large-paragraph faq-ans">Yes. We offer modular pricing and can tailor the scope to match your current stage and needs.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="1d2aabcf-baec-ed5c-090e-1c581a1932c8" class="accordion w-dropdown"><div class="accordion-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-icon-div"><img src="/images/faq-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="FAQ arrow icon" class="faq-icon"></div><div class="large-paragraph faq-heading">How fast can you deliver?</div></div><nav class="accordion-list w-dropdown-list"><p class="large-paragraph faq-ans">Timelines vary, but MVP designs typically ship in 2–4 weeks. We move fast, without cutting corners.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="1d2aabcf-baec-ed5c-090e-1c581a1932d1" class="accordion w-dropdown"><div class="accordion-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-icon-div"><img src="/images/faq-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="FAQ arrow icon" class="faq-icon"></div><div class="large-paragraph faq-heading">Do you handle development too?</div></div><nav class="accordion-list w-dropdown-list"><p class="large-paragraph faq-ans">We’re design-first, but we can connect you with vetted developers or teams we trust.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="1d2aabcf-baec-ed5c-090e-1c581a1932da" class="accordion w-dropdown"><div class="accordion-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-icon-div"><img src="/images/faq-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="FAQ arrow icon" class="faq-icon"></div><div class="large-paragraph faq-heading">Are your designs dev-ready?</div></div><nav class="accordion-list w-dropdown-list"><p class="large-paragraph faq-ans">Yes. Every design is Figma-based, responsive, and built with API integration and handoff in mind.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="1d2aabcf-baec-ed5c-090e-1c581a1932e3" class="accordion w-dropdown"><div class="accordion-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-icon-div"><img src="/images/faq-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="FAQ arrow icon" class="faq-icon"></div><div class="large-paragraph faq-heading">Do you design for AI-specific products?</div></div><nav class="accordion-list w-dropdown-list"><p class="large-paragraph faq-ans">Absolutely. We have experience with LLM interfaces, agent workflows, prompt design, and more.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="1d2aabcf-baec-ed5c-090e-1c581a1932ec" class="accordion w-dropdown"><div class="accordion-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-icon-div"><img src="/images/faq-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="FAQ arrow icon" class="faq-icon"></div><div class="large-paragraph faq-heading">What if I need help after launch?</div></div><nav class="accordion-list w-dropdown-list"><p class="large-paragraph faq-ans">Our Scale plan includes post-launch support. We also offer retainer options.</p></nav></div></div></div></div></div></section><footer data-wf--footer--variant="base" class="footer w-variant-5d5f9124-0cb4-afa2-7ecf-b659e3494a8f"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div data-w-id="27f70677-75bf-a86c-24f6-d3410ee1e56a" class="footer-detail-div"><div class="footer-link-div"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/" target="_blank" class="paragraph footer-text-link">Instagram</a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/" target="_blank" class="paragraph footer-text-link">Facebook</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/" target="_blank" class="paragraph footer-text-link">LinkedIn</a><a href="https://twitter.com/" target="_blank" class="paragraph footer-text-link">X</a></div><div class="footer-link-div"><a href="/about-us" class="paragraph footer-text-link">About us</a><a href="/work" class="paragraph footer-text-link">Work</a><a href="/services" class="paragraph footer-text-link">Services</a><a href="/pricing" class="paragraph footer-text-link">Pricing</a><a href="/blog" class="paragraph footer-text-link">Blog</a><a href="/contact-us" class="paragraph footer-text-link">Contact Us</a></div><div class="footer-link-div"><a href="/templates/license" class="paragraph footer-text-link">License</a><a href="/templates/changelog" class="paragraph footer-text-link">Changelog</a><a href="/templates/styleguide" class="paragraph footer-text-link">Style guide</a></div></div><div data-w-id="27f70677-75bf-a86c-24f6-d3410ee1e588" class="footer-line-div"></div><div data-w-id="27f70677-75bf-a86c-24f6-d3410ee1e589" class="footer-bottom-div"><div class="footer-detail-div"><a href="/" aria-current="page" class="brand-logo-link w-inline-block w--current"><img src="/images/footer-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Logo" class="footer-logo"></a><div class="paragraph medium-font footer-line">|</div><div class="paragraph medium-font">&copy; 2026 Soale Agency. All rights reserved.</div></div><div class="footer-copyright-div"><a href="https://astro.build/" target="_blank" class="footer-copyright-button background-color w-button">Powered by AstroJS</a></div></div></div></footer>
<script is:inline>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
    const serviceParam = params.get('service');
    if (serviceParam) {
      const select = document.getElementById('Service-required');
      if (select) {
        const key = serviceParam.toLowerCase();
        for (let i = 0; i < select.options.length; i++) {
          const optVal = select.options[i].value.toLowerCase();
          if (
            (key.includes('workflow') && optVal.includes('workflow')) ||
            (key.includes('support') && optVal.includes('support')) ||
            (key.includes('lead') && optVal.includes('lead')) ||
            (key.includes('document') && optVal.includes('document')) ||
            (key.includes('analytics') && optVal.includes('analytics')) ||
            (key.includes('bi') && optVal.includes('analytics'))
          ) {
            select.selectedIndex = i;
            break;
          }
        }
      }
    }
  });
</script>
